{"type":"message","id":"9047c6db","parentId":"819c1e71","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:13:24.310Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Identifying issues with filtering**\n\nI need to summarize the task of filtering out specified false positives. There's something that came up about a deep run producing weird output, which might indicate a bug in the process. It's important to consider that if errors are arising, running a more in-depth check might help clarify things. It feels like there’s enough evidence to suggest something isn't working as it should. Let's keep exploring this to find a solution!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0450f1e7b4a0c34c0169b461cb6b608191a6fb424a25db4b5c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABptGHO8Ab1RO5xxmwWJfFARss45axG8VO1HZ2kgKLqniZTKy2AGfe4r-C_oxh3bxMLQoKNPXQ05IIawnP-7IpRvjwawrvDjV6JHupd3BCDCm84zLMHN32NXyagFNSTiktN6Sz5a6WCMHuVF5AS0zmGiKJUWDeeO58pF5WVrfAkghAU8QKPt1VItnZ0_MjWufZDRFFr6vq3-eiPyOsQWmXuAPzBDhnZYxIejMICTFvdlGZzXPfkAm1hzpJjABBl5wZMOrgMj9LtOrPeq_15Xo_BG0NeI5R1bZ7SohfFSKR95lLyNuOgoYjJwJisc5AgP7bxya_DCh8f0zVdQxuuftpuFAGlKez-GW7HFNbmJdvdbR4nNFOSvnPY1f69Fr27f1EgfGP2aR5REPb8vwHqIbWQkO4Wt3p15JrwgtQOacrZ18RNSl_eQnkGmVYAVrjfgcqIG1QKiB7n4IPPl_g3AGtwNQOSwAYg37F0BxJzyWVPaI8qt8g66A3Gh_fIaRvkR68h5LvYU5b3xxj10VQsdfZLgZq5O8aYiGosSY89PfNDcE8bdbCTUTx1-AWODn5t3wNi0cvGKm0uY9CA2n-JcsJ8oVOmh9H7zZwjjHZIxAiq98LjJCp_3AmUHyeY56UYOZfw8N9BkB3eR6SmsEmQ3mqxpPgGUY1cDghy7s2S-_A54xdrtpf3o0m_5fQ90FL9DJ_KzzD1WDX5aYb7ged5PYUuoJsPb6bT7IS2slAIOon_CndYvEm3-maddqok8GVhptp70L5W8HrV0w9cKlq1M9SCO6raPMBy8JQTQXtACNhM5FBL-ORZ322kWwSpDPhpSuYF8Hkts2XAGh2lmYf7KrCUVh1BFV8LSFhcj4pbO0kR4dV1bMtYcpXGWOQ_CXJ-hjq4ms84HJy2IwexCijuFmCIzd3O5A0D3uNYmAqIdTJ99mAnU2YFGQKcQHBx1wGvUTMMGDFNuAQgbtGzWlGa11J0fULwZhz3Wponza2OqqaFS1JF31w=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Identifying issues with filtering**\\n\\nI need to summarize the task of filtering out specified false positives. There's something that came up about a deep run producing weird output, which might indicate a bug in the process. It's important to consider that if errors are arising, running a more in-depth check might help clarify things. It feels like there’s enough evidence to suggest something isn't working as it should. Let's keep exploring this to find a solution!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"보안 감사 결과 요약 (`openclaw security audit --deep` 실행)\n\n필터링한 false positive:\n- tavily-search: `scripts/extract.mjs`, `scripts/search.mjs`\n- claude-mem: `bun-runner.js`, `context-generator.cjs`, `mcp-server.cjs`, `smart-install.js`, `worker-cli.js`\n- writing-skills: `render-graphs.js`\n\n필터링 후 유효 결과:\n- Critical: 0\n- Warn: 2\n- Info: 1\n\n경고 사항:\n1. `gateway.trusted_proxies_missing`\n   - `gateway.bind`가 loopback인데 `gateway.trustedProxies`가 비어 있음\n   - Control UI를 reverse proxy 뒤로 노출 중이면 trusted proxy 설정 필요\n   - 로컬 전용이면 현상 유지 가능\n\n2. `plugins.tools_reachable_permissive_policy`\n   - 활성화된 extension plugin: `claude-mem`\n   - permissive tool policy가 적용되는 컨텍스트:\n     - `default`\n     - `agents.list.main`\n   - 권고: untrusted input를 다루는 에이전트에는 `minimal`/`coding` 프로필 또는 명시적 allowlist 적용\n\n정보:\n- 공격면 요약\n  - groups: open=0, allowlist=1\n  - elevated tools: enabled\n  - webhooks: disabled\n  - internal hooks: enabled\n  - browser control: enabled\n  - trust model: 단일 신뢰 운영자 기준 personal assistant 모드\n\n추가 관찰:\n- 실행 중 doctor warning 1건:\n  - `channels.telegram.groupPolicy=allowlist` 인데 `groupAllowFrom`/`allowFrom`가 비어 있어 그룹 메시지가 모두 드롭될 수 있음\n  - 그룹 응답이 필요하다면 sender allowlist 추가 또는 정책 재검토 필요\n\n판단:\n- 지정한 false positive를 제외하면 즉시 조치가 필요한 치명적 이슈는 없음\n- 실제 운영 리스크는 `trustedProxies` 설정 누락 가능성과 plugin tool policy 완화 범위 점검 쪽에 있음","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0450f1e7b4a0c34c0169b461ce60688191a748bb2ff198652b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":1559,"output":487,"cacheRead":18816,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20862,"cost":{"input":0.0038975000000000004,"output":0.007305,"cacheRead":0.004704,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0159065}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773429192408}}
